{"id":"n79167-2-7","stage":4,"title":"체크 · 格子","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n79167-2-7-1","ko":"셔츠를 하나 사러 왔는데 어떤 게 좋을까요?","zh":"我来买件衬衫，不知道该选哪款好呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"셔츠를","meaning":"衬衫","explanation":"셔츠：衬衫；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"셔츠","audio":"/audio/0f9ab32a190bfc019f18.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64284","senseId":"1","lemma":"셔츠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하나","meaning":"想要，想买","explanation":"하다：想要，想买；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"9","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사러","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔는데","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"某个","explanation":"어떤：某个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"3","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋을까요?","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0f9ab32a190bfc01","term":"셔츠","zh":"衬衫","audio":"/audio/0f9ab32a190bfc019f18.mp3","entryId":"64284","definition":"可穿在西装内，也可外穿的西式上衣。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"想要，想买","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"购买或得到某种东西。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"某个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"没有必要明确地指出是哪个对象时使用的话。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/766dd86a15560d37a767.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n79167-2-7-2","ko":"이 체크 셔츠는 어떠세요?","zh":"这款格子衬衫怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"체크","meaning":"格子，格纹","explanation":"체크：格子，格纹","readings":[{"term":"체크","audio":"/audio/3b1b15fe6e634123679d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79167","senseId":"2","lemma":"체크","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"셔츠는","meaning":"衬衫","explanation":"셔츠：衬衫；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"셔츠","audio":"/audio/0f9ab32a190bfc019f18.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64284","senseId":"1","lemma":"셔츠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떠세요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；으세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"3b1b15fe6e634123","term":"체크","zh":"格子，格纹","audio":"/audio/3b1b15fe6e634123679d.mp3","entryId":"79167","definition":"棋盘状的图案；或指带有此图案的纺织品。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"0f9ab32a190bfc01","term":"셔츠","zh":"衬衫","audio":"/audio/0f9ab32a190bfc019f18.mp3","entryId":"64284","definition":"可穿在西装内，也可外穿的西式上衣。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/da4e8c5f3b5132e7d9a2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.83,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=79167","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":137,"sequenceScore":2.6567,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这款格子衬衫怎么样？","我来买件衬衫，不知道该选哪款好呢？","妈妈，我的冬装放在哪儿了？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我来买件衬衫，不知道该选哪款好呢？","妈妈，我的冬装放在哪儿了？","这款格子衬衫怎么样？"],"answer":2}]}
